<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Home - My Website</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
<h1> Welcome to my website</h1>
<p>This is my first web page created in SET08101</p>

<h1>Heading Level 1</h1>
<h2>Heading Level 2</h2>
<h3>Heading Level 3</h3>
<h4>Heading Level 4</h4>
<h5>Heading Level 5</h5>
<h6>Heading Level 6</h6>
<p>This is the first paragraph. It contains multiple sentences.</p>

<p>This is the second paragraph.<br>
This line uses a break tag to start a new line within the same paragraph.</p>

<img src="images/Forest-4928x3264.jpg" width="600" height="400" alt="Forest image for test">
<hr>
<p>This text is <strong>strongly important</strong>.</p>
<p>This text has <em>emphasis</em>.</p>
<p>This word is <mark>highlighted</mark>.</p>
<p>This is <code>inline code</code>.</p>

<!-- Unordered (bullet) list -->
<ul>
    <li>First item</li>
    <li>Second item</li>
    <li>Third item</li>
</ul>

<!-- Ordered (numbered) list -->
<ol>
    <li>Step one</li>
    <li>Step two</li>
    <li>Step three</li>
</ol>

<!-- Nested list -->
<ul>
    <li>Main item
        <ul>
            <li>Sub-item one</li>
            <li>Sub-item two</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
</ul>

<!-- Internal link to another page on your site -->
<a href="about.html">About Page</a>

<!-- External link to another website -->
<a href="https://www.w3schools.com/" target="_blank">W3Schools</a>



</body>
</html>
